# Changes on top of the U-Boot fork's licheepi_nano_defconfig, for a faster boot

# boot straight away instead of counting down for 2 seconds, and don't look for a key press to
# stop at the U-Boot prompt either: with a serial adapter wired to the console but not plugged into
# anything, the floating line reads as key presses and the board stopped there (a white screen).
# To get to the prompt now: a card without boot.scr, or FEL.
CONFIG_BOOTDELAY=-2
# nothing is plugged into USB, so don't scan it at every boot
# CONFIG_USE_PREBOOT is not set
